.png file decoder in c

Usage:
Look at main.c for example usage.
Main API function is decode_png_file, which returns RGBA bytes as a 1D array
in scanlines.
Look at "decoder.h" for a more detailed explanation of the function.

Limitations: only truecolor alpha

Other stuff:
Includes DEFLATE spec decompressor

